# Submission bundles: generated binaries; rebuild from .tex (see README_FOR_ALEXANDER.md).
# Recursive, so it also covers dated submission_YYYY-MM-DD/ snapshot folders and any
# *.zip review/upload packages placed inside the bundle directory. Scoped to the bundle
# so tracked source figures under paper/figs/*.pdf are not affected.
paper/submission_bundle_*/**/*.pdf
paper/submission_bundle_*/**/*.zip
paper/submission_bundle_*.zip
paper/main_diff.tex
paper/main_diff.pdf
