# Future-work scaffolding (per paper/revision_tracker.md R2.5).
# `scripts/build_table3_segmenter_agreement.py` (`make table3-segmenter-agreement`)
# produces a four-column segmenter-agreement table whose output is mirrored
# into paper/figs/ by `make sync`, but the current manuscript does not
# reference it. Kept ignored to avoid carrying unused artefacts in the
# repo; re-allow if/when the table is included in a future revision.
paper/figs/table3_segmenter_agreement.*

# Producer-side lobe-compartment heatmap mirrored into paper/figs/ by
# `make sync`. The current manuscript does not reference this PDF
# (the lobe summary in the Results section is rendered inline from
# the per-subject Hit-Plot CSVs instead). Kept ignored to avoid
# carrying an unused artefact in the repo; re-allow if/when a future
# revision cites it directly.
paper/figs/fig_lobe_compartment_heatmap_gt.pdf

# Rebuildable production-delivery artifacts for JMET article 2713703.
paper/production_delivery/JMET_2713703_editable_manuscript/generated/
